  "details": "Please add Animator Parameters that can be used under the same conditions as the Warp Effect, not just the effect itself.\n\nThe Warp Effect is fantastic, but one of VRChat greatest strengths is that users can create their own content. Simply using the features provided by VRChat makes it feel like an ordinary game, limiting what creators can truly achieve.\n\nFor example, if similar functionality were available as Animator Parameters, we could implement effects like Dissolve on avatar materials — but currently, it’s not possible to do so for items. Expanding this functionality would open up many more creative possibilities for users.",
